# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The grace is one lease plus the margin precisely
# so every lease the previous activation granted has lapsed; the mutant ends it
# with those leases still trusted.
MODULE: GraceElapseKeepsOldLeases
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the grace ends while leases from the previous activation stay trusted
PERTURBS: GraceElapse
BOUNDS: MaxRestarts = 1

--- FIND
    /\ lease' = [t \in Silos |-> IF lease[t] = "old" THEN "none" ELSE lease[t]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: old leases outlive the grace.
    /\ lease' = lease
--- END
